From: Utopia contributors
Subject: [EXPERIMENT] imm32: provide a Hearthstone-only fixed candidate anchor

Based on Wine 11.19 (commit 455e3509b98a6919fd4ad1def4803e08c41c03b2).
Copyright 2026 Utopia contributors; modified Wine LGPL-2.1-or-later source.
No game memory, client binary, composition text or key input is inspected.
Enable only for Hearthstone with UTOPIA_HEARTHSTONE_FIXED_IME=1.

--- a/dlls/imm32/ime.c
+++ b/dlls/imm32/ime.c
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 /*
